{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["<b>And Moses was not able to enter the tent of meeting.</b> At the time of its erection, <b>for the cloud abode upon it</b> immediately, to show the belovedness of HaKadosh Baruch Hu toward Israel. But afterward the cloud would withdraw from inside the tent and rest upon the ark, as it is written: ונועדתי לך שם ודברתי אתך מעל הכפרת, and then Moses would enter, as it says: ובבא משה אל אהל מועד etc. So too you find in the eternal house: ולא יכלו הכהנים לעמוד לשרת מפני הענן כי מלא כבוד ה׳ את בית ה׳ — at the time of the completion of the work of the house, HaKadosh Baruch Hu would sanctify it with the cloud, and afterward He would contract His presence upon the ark between the poles."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:02:17.366354699Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}